    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a simple puzzle game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click and slide the hexagon to solve it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857880/extras/79f6ee3921a244c48e47334b7daefed7.avif?t=1755068692\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game's rule is simple.You just move the hexagon.Numbers of each hexagon must be equal to count of hexagons on the same direction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 28 stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the first game I am publishing on Steam.\u00a0I am releasing this game as a free game.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a simple puzzle game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click and slide the hexagon to solve it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857880/extras/79f6ee3921a244c48e47334b7daefed7.avif?t=1755068692\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game's rule is simple.You just move the hexagon.Numbers of each hexagon must be equal to count of hexagons on the same direction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 28 stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the first game I am publishing on Steam.\u00a0I am releasing this game as a free game.</p>",
